{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Bratz2_SteamBanner_ENG_615x54_1.png?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to 6 style cities including London, Milan, and Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_1_Fashion_Tour.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Bratz2_SteamBanner_ENG_615x54_2.png?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start a fashion and dance adventure with your BFFs, the Bratz Pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_2_Walk_the_runway.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule the runway and take the stage with Cloe, Yasmin, Sasha, and Jade. Conquer the world in style, creating customizable fashions in the Bratz Fashion Studios. Showcase your signature looks and groove to your favorite songs from the Bratz universe, including \u2018So Good\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Bratz2_SteamBanner_ENG_615x54_3.png?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your outfits, hairstyles, and makeup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_3_Design_new_styles.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jet off to iconic cities, from Paris to Tokyo, but watch out for \u2013 self-proclaimed \u201cStyle Queen\u201d, Burdine and the Tweevil Twins who are determined to steal the spotlight. Can you out-style and out-dance them in epic fashion battles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Bratz2_SteamBanner_ENG_615x54_4.png?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge \u2013 party in single or multiplayer with up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_4_Play_Together.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Bratz2_SteamBanner_ENG_615x54_5.png?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_5_Iconics_style.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's time to express yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>FASHION TOUR -</strong> Travel to 6 style cities including London, Milan, and Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WALK THE RUNWAY -</strong> Compete in fashion show, dancing, and fitness games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DESIGN NEW STYLES -</strong> Customize your outfits, hairstyles, and makeup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>PLAY TOGETHER \u2013</strong> Play solo or enjoy with your best friends, up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>ICONIC STYLE \u2013</strong> Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3212580?t=1748617061","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/e980ce51bf6989aa49af3015a599626753e27c2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748617061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/ebb558daad859d80c2e3e0c2021a587b451dd3fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748617061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/ebb558daad859d80c2e3e0c2021a587b451dd3fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748617061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Bratz2_SteamBanner_ENG_615x54_1.png?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to 6 style cities including London, Milan, and Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_1_Fashion_Tour.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse