aragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_4_Play_Together.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Bratz2_SteamBanner_ENG_615x54_5.png?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/extras/Gif_5_Iconics_style.gif?t=1748617061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's time to express yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>FASHION TOUR -</strong> Travel to 6 style cities including London, Milan, and Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WALK THE RUNWAY -</strong> Compete in fashion show, dancing, and fitness games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DESIGN NEW STYLES -</strong> Customize your outfits, hairstyles, and makeup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>PLAY TOGETHER \u2013</strong> Play solo or enjoy with your best friends, up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>ICONIC STYLE \u2013</strong> Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz.</p>","developers":["Recotechnology S.L."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212580/e191789d5852ed5c2c27183888ca58017b5378fb/header.jpg?t=1748617061","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 MGA Entertainment, Inc. Bratz\u00ae is a trademark of MGA in the U.S. and other countries. All logos, names, characters, likenesses, images, slogans